## Velocity
- Autonomous AI QA Engineer

Give it the ticket. Let it test.

Velocity is an autonomous AI QA agent designed to perform the work of a manual software tester end-to-end.

Instead of executing predefined Selenium/Playwright scripts, Velocity understands a testing objective, plans what needs to be tested, operates applications through a controlled environment, investigates unexpected behavior, collects evidence, and generates structured test reports and bug reports.